\name{import_zenodo_inbox}
\alias{import_zenodo_inbox}
\title{Rebuild an inbox contribution in the private review queue}
\usage{import_zenodo_inbox(fields, queue)}
\arguments{
\item{fields}{Named list of received link-only inbox fields.}
\item{queue}{Administrator-controlled persistent private queue directory.}
}
\value{Pending proposal ID. Repeated imports are deduplicated.}
\description{Re-fetches Zenodo metadata and validates coverage and file mappings before storing a pending proposal. Never approves or publishes a contribution.}
\details{This maintainer operation supports link-only Formspree fields generated by ALSdownloadeR. Boundary links must exactly match the Zenodo record. Only one bounded boundary file is retrieved; point clouds are not downloaded. Inbox authentication and delivery are configured separately. No inbox API key is bundled.}
